# Components

```
src/components/<kebab-name>/
  <name>.component.tsx
  helpers/                 # optional
  index.ts
```

Import via `import { Button, Typography, Flex } from "@/components"`.

## Styling

```ts
import { StyleSheet } from "react-native-unistyles";

const styles = StyleSheet.create(({ space, colors, radius }) => ({
  container: {
    padding: space(2),
    backgroundColor: colors.background,
    borderRadius: radius.md,
  },
}));
```

- Use `space(n)` (8px grid) — never raw `padding: 16`
- Prefer semantic colors (`primary`, `textPrimary`, `error`, …); use scale tokens
  (`primary9`, `slate3`) only when no semantic fits
- Variants via StyleSheet `variants` + `styles.useVariants({ … })`

## Typography — DM Sans only

- Always use `Typography` for text — avoid raw `<Text>` outside primitives
- Sole family: **DM Sans** (loaded in `src/app/_layout.tsx`)
- Weights map to named faces via `getFontFamily` — never set numeric `fontWeight`
  or another `fontFamily` in features
- For `TextInput`, use `FONT_FAMILY.regular` from `@/lib/fonts`
- Weight guidance: body `regular`; labels/chips `medium`; section titles / CTAs
  `semibold`; screen titles `bold`
- Size tokens (fontSize / lineHeight): `text-xs` 12/16, `text-sm` 14/20,
  `text-md` 16/22, `text-lg` 18/24, `text-xl` 20/28, `display-xs` 24/30,
  `display-sm` 28/34, `display-md` 34/40

## Buttons

Hierarchy: primary filled = book/commit; secondary outlined = dismiss;
error = destructive. Soft radius (`radius.md`) by default.
